{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-b932ca3bcfc96448c8f003c4ee2af0236756460160dcf965","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"92a76dce7fe4e65b9dbd12d7d4648b1f083225f5fe77d80e64d94c376cf881e0","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Attached Form No. 9] <Amended on April 5, 2007>\n\n(Front)\n\nTraffic, Energy and Environment Tax — Articles\n[ ] Without Payment of Tax  [ ] Tax-Exempt\n[ ] Report of Entry  [ ] Application for Certification of Entry  [ ] Certificate of Entry\n\nProcessing period: 5 days.\n\nApplicant and Receiving Party\n\n| ① Name (representative) | ② Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ③ Business name (corporate name) | ④ Telephone number |\n| | |\n| ⑤ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| ⑥ Place of entry | ⑦ Business registration number |\n| | |\n| ⑧ Date of entry | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ |\n| ⑨ Deadline for submitting certificate of entry | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ |\n\nReleasing Party\n\n| ⑩ Name (representative) | |\n|---|---|\n| ⑪ Business name (corporate name) | |\n| ⑫ Address (location of head office) | |\n| ⑬ Place of release | |\n| ⑭ Business registration number | |\n| ⑮ Release approval number | No. ______ |\n| ⑯ Date of release approval | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ |\n\nDetails of Application\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>⑰ Name of article</th><th>⑱ Quantity</th><th>⑲ Specifications</th><th>⑳ Unit price</th><th>㉑ Price</th><th>㉒ Tax rate</th><th>㉓ Tax amount</th><th>㉔ Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n| ㉕ Reason for entry | Article ____ (____), subparagraph ____, of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act |\n|---|---|\n| ㉖ Matters for reference | |\n\nI report that the articles entered as set out above, pursuant to the checked provision of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act, and request certification of that fact:\n[ ] Article 12 (2)\n[ ] Article 12 (5)\n[ ] Article 15 (3)\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office / Customs Office\n\nNo. ______\n\nI certify that the facts concerning entry stated above are correct.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nHead of the Tax Office / Customs Office: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\nRequired documents: None.\n※ This report/application form is distributed free of charge.\nFee: None.\n\nGeneral paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis report/application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office / customs office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare report/application</td><td>2. Receive it (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide (Final decision delegated to the department head)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>5. Prepare certificate (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe report/application proceeds from box 1 rightward to box 2, then downward through boxes 3, 4, and 5. The final arrow runs leftward and upward from box 5 to the applicant and is labelled “Issue certificate.”\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\6d559247d8075002f80d1333f56599e3e0e006825ca6a44c55cebfa2837e27a6.ascii.json","sha256":"6d559247d8075002f80d1333f56599e3e0e006825ca6a44c55cebfa2837e27a6"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"3f5f43155bef600eca0ba92d4d5c3d1900dce1e946c245f8cce550a3b8f1d29c","unit_key":"form-000900F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"557fc57d38074852565002dedbddfbd84e5f5f29619fd1b618a43ddad60fad68","unit_key":"form-000902F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"3f5f43155bef600eca0ba92d4d5c3d1900dce1e946c245f8cce550a3b8f1d29c","source_law_id":"kr-006574-270243-ko","source_review_complete":true,"source_xml_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","target_body_sha256":"b49c502fd68babb16734bd2caf5d31d2c3626425ac38395bc83567df2d884c88","unit_key":"form-000900F"},"unit_key":"form-000900F"}],"author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"caf0dcf5c50a9f70581ce8b6bff50b953f3d3a7a30a17edbf83172f05b5f4e7e"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.units.parts\\form-000900F.json","sha256":"98a0ea286788d9ef6a3d81cef5e11b1a970100a9ad464123379cb60a673e7434"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.units.parts\\form-000900F.selfcheck.json","sha256":"bc652b0894a467d7b6481379cd5ea489b4033f01116c1e